    "detailed_description": "&quot;Type Fast to Survive!&quot;<br><br>You are protecting your city from AI drones by controlling a turret. You are behind a screen of Camera showing the turret and incoming enemies. The enemies showing with a tag displaying theri ID's, which are different words.<br><br>To make the turret targeting and firing to enemies, you have to type the ID of the drone correctly. And you should type fast to gain more points. <br><br>This Game will improve your typing skills, you can see your typing speed in the game as &quot;letter per second, and word per minute&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352770/extras/1aee02519bd904662cf1a85c1e7f7b35.avif?t=1680227490\" /></span>",
